{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>And those who act wickedly against the covenant</b> — this speaks of Titus, because many of Israel forsook their covenant." "<b>And the meaning of בחלקות</b> — as in: 'They spoke flatteries to us, therefore we followed him.' And 'those who know their God' — He is the honored Name — they will strengthen their heart." "<b>And they shall do</b> — as He commanded in His Torah."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :register {:flags {1 ["God"]}}, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:21:14.017469151Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}